DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Manipulate the verbose description of a device.  This description (if
     present) is printed as part of the message when it is attached during au‐
     toconfiguration.  The variation ddeevviiccee__sseett__ddeesscc__ccooppyy() is used to set the
     description if the string passed is a temporary buffer which will be
     overwritten.  In this case, the system will copy the string, otherwise
     the pointer passed will be used directly.  ddeevviiccee__sseett__ddeessccff() is a
     printf-like version of ddeevviiccee__sseett__ddeesscc().

